---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About Aron Kylebäck - Makerclub president, student council president, and incoming computer science student at Högskolan i Skövde."
>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">About</h1>

  <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-neutral-700">
    <p>
      I'm based in Skövde, Sweden,starting a degree in datavetenskap (computer science) with a systems specialization at Högskolan i Skövde, in 2027.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm president of my school's Makerclub, where we run and maintain a fleet of six Ender 3 V3 SE printers and the makerspace they live in.
      I'm also student council president, representing the students on budget, events, policy and more.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of school, I split time between two part-time jobs, alongside
      self-hosting a homelab and building side projects.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most of what I do outside class ties back to systems in some way; the
      homelab is where I actually build, test, and deploy things, from
      self-hosted services to networking. I also do CTF challenges and
      wargames on the side, and 3D printing bridges the maker and systems
      sides, Makerclub's printer fleet included.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
